      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "わたし、ディートリヒさんを応援してるんです！\n戦っている姿を見て、素敵だなって思ってて……\nその気持ちを詩にしたので、届けて貰えませんか？\nお姿は、よくマーズ神殿の近くでお見かけします。",
        "official_en": "The one I truly admire is Dietrich! Seeing him fight\nsends chills down my spine, and I was moved to\ncompose a poem for him. Can you give it to him? I\noften see him by Mars's temple.",
        "real_en": "I'm cheering for Dietrich-san! When I saw him fighting, I thought he looked wonderful... I put those feelings into a poem. Could you deliver it to him? I often see him near Mars's temple."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
